OL,3,GNEWSAScottish council website carried
OL,4,Alinks to offshore casino sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople looking for information about
OL,7,Fcommunity councils in the Scottish
OL,8,FBorders have instead been directed to
OL,9,Fonline gambling portals.
OL,11,FScottish Borders Council's website has
OL,12,Fa directory listing all 69 community
OL,13,Fcouncils across the region, including
OL,14,Flinks to their social media pages,
OL,15,Femail contacts and websites.
OL,17,FBut BBC Scotland News has found that 16
OL,18,Fof those links were instead directing
OL,19,Fusers to pages displaying offshore
OL,20,Fcasino websites, which bypass strict UK
OL,21,Fgambling laws.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
