OL,3,GNEWSAScottish council website carried
OL,4,Alinks to offshore casino sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority removed the links
OL,7,Fwhen alerted to the situation by the
OL,8,FBBC, but did not respond to a request
OL,9,Ffor comment.
